WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Alright!

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.300
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:11.900
A.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.533
Square,

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:13.133
B.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:13.767
Triangle,

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:14.367
C.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:15.000
Circle,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.233
or D.

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:16.833
Cube?

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:18.067
Five seconds!

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:25.067
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:26.200
It's...

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:26.633
D,

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:27.100
cube!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.000
A square,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.467
triangle,

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:31.200
and circle are all flat shapes.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.933
A cube is a solid shape

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.300
you can hold,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.567
so it does not belong.

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:39.133
So,

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:41.167
are you smart or fart?

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.600
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.800
find your rank!

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:46.300
So,

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.700
how did you do?

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.067
Comment your score below,

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.433
and follow for more!
